  "summary": "pysha3 vulnerability",
  "details": "Nicky Mouha discovered that pysha3 incorrectly handled certain SHA-3\noperations, leading to an integer overflow. An attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to cause pysha3 to crash, resulting in a denial of service, or\npossibly execute arbitrary code.",
